{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791987631079,"sessionID":"ses_ec53aa391ffe0Yfcjlez04t8W4","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_726af914aaa04f22a1a68c2d","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"E:\\Work_Hub\\01_Automemory\\wt-arc-kill2\\initiatives\\distribute\\evidence\\phase-10\\demo.md"},"output":"<path>E:\\Work_Hub\\01_Automemory\\wt-arc-kill2\\initiatives\\distribute\\evidence\\phase-10\\demo.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Phase 10 live demo — a venture born with every harness, watched by the radar, then uninstalled\n2: \n3: 2026-10-14, branch head `e08d759f`, a fresh git repo holding one owner file (`README.md`). `ARC_PRIVATE_DIR` pointed\n4: at a demo dir and the radar's receipt went to a demo spine (`ARC_SPINE_ROOT`), so nothing reached the owner's\n5: registry or the canonical spine. Paths below are shortened to `<demo>`.\n6: \n7: ```\n8: $ node bin/arc.mjs init --dir <venture>\n9: plan: claude-code+codex+opencode+skills-only — 669 file(s) into <demo>/venture\n10: apply: wrote 670 file(s) into <demo>\\venture (every harness); record .arc-install.json\n11: hooks: core.hooksPath=.claude/templates/githooks (branch guard + secret scan at commit time)\n12: registry: registered <demo>\\venture\n13: exit=0\n14: dirs at birth: .agents/skills .arc-install.json .claude .codex .opencode \n15: $ node bin/arc.mjs outdated --all\n16: <demo>\\venture · up to date\n17: outdated --all: 1 project(s) · 0 behind · 1 up to date · 0 unmeasurable · 0 missing\n18: RAN arc-outdated\n19: $ ARC_RADAR_FORCE=1 node .claude/scripts/hq/jobs/distribute-radar.mjs   # test spine\n20: distribute-radar: metric.observed 01M4WPQMPWKJJRP9KC6BA3V3C1 · 0 of 1 behind · 0 unmeasurable · 0 missing\n21: $ node bin/arc.mjs uninstall --dir <venture>\n22: hooks: core.hooksPath unset (init had set it to .claude/templates/githooks)\n23: registry: removed <demo>\\venture\n24: uninstall: 669 removed, 0 kept, record .arc-install.json removed\n25: RAN arc-uninstall\n26: left after: .git README.md \n27: README: my venture\n28: ```\n29: \n30: REQ-15: every harness directory and one version-2 record at birth, registered. REQ-18: every managed file removed,\n31: the owner's `README.md` intact, and the hooks path init had set is unset. REQ-19: one path-free `metric.observed`\n32: (`value` 0, `unit_count` 1). The radar's production run waits for the owner's one-line apply of the job\n33: (`owner-apply-radar-policy.mjs`, ADR-2026 Amendment 1). The launch slot clause of REQ-15 waits for the launch lane\n34: (`../phase-08/launch-prompt.md`).\n\n(End of file - total 34 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Phase 10 live demo — a venture born with every harness, watched by the radar, then uninstalled\n\n2026-10-14, branch head `e08d759f`, a fresh git repo holding one owner file (`README.md`). `ARC_PRIVATE_DIR` pointed\nat a demo dir and the radar's receipt went to a demo spine (`ARC_SPINE_ROOT`), so nothing reached the owner's\nregistry or the canonical spine. Paths below are shortened to `<demo>`.\n\n```\n$ node bin/arc.mjs init --dir <venture>\nplan: claude-code+codex+opencode+skills-only — 669 file(s) into <demo>/venture\napply: wrote 670 file(s) into <demo>\\venture (every harness); record .arc-install.json\nhooks: core.hooksPath=.claude/templates/githooks (branch guard + secret scan at commit time)\nregistry: registered <demo>\\venture\nexit=0\ndirs at birth: .agents/skills .arc-install.json .claude .codex .opencode \n$ node bin/arc.mjs outdated --all\n<demo>\\venture · up to date\noutdated --all: 1 project(s) · 0 behind · 1 up to date · 0 unmeasurable · 0 missing\nRAN arc-outdated\n$ ARC_RADAR_FORCE=1 node .claude/scripts/hq/jobs/distribute-radar.mjs   # test spine\ndistribute-radar: metric.observed 01M4WPQMPWKJJRP9KC6BA3V3C1 · 0 of 1 behind · 0 unmeasurable · 0 missing","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"E:\\Work_Hub\\01_Automemory\\wt-arc-kill2\\initiatives\\distribute\\evidence\\phase-10\\demo.md","text":"# Phase 10 live demo — a venture born with every harness, watched by the radar, then uninstalled\n\n2026-10-14, branch head `e08d759f`, a fresh git repo holding one owner file (`README.md`). `ARC_PRIVATE_DIR` pointed\nat a demo dir and the radar's receipt went to a demo spine (`ARC_SPINE_ROOT`), so nothing reached the owner's\nregistry or the canonical spine. Paths below are shortened to `<demo>`.\n\n```\n$ node bin/arc.mjs init --dir <venture>\nplan: claude-code+codex+opencode+skills-only — 669 file(s) into <demo>/venture\napply: wrote 670 file(s) into <demo>\\venture (every harness); record .arc-install.json\nhooks: core.hooksPath=.claude/templates/githooks (branch guard + secret scan at commit time)\nregistry: registered <demo>\\venture\nexit=0\ndirs at birth: .agents/skills .arc-install.json .claude .codex .opencode \n$ node bin/arc.mjs outdated --all\n<demo>\\venture · up to date\noutdated --all: 1 project(s) · 0 behind · 1 up to date · 0 unmeasurable · 0 missing\nRAN arc-outdated\n$ ARC_RADAR_FORCE=1 node .claude/scripts/hq/jobs/distribute-radar.mjs   # test spine\ndistribute-radar: metric.observed 01M4WPQMPWKJJRP9KC6BA3V3C1 · 0 of 1 behind · 0 unmeasurable · 0 missing\n$ node bin/arc.mjs uninstall --dir <venture>\nhooks: core.hooksPath unset (init had set it to .claude/templates/githooks)\nregistry: removed <demo>\\venture\nuninstall: 669 removed, 0 kept, record .arc-install.json removed\nRAN arc-uninstall\nleft after: .git README.md \nREADME: my venture\n```\n\nREQ-15: every harness directory and one version-2 record at birth, registered. REQ-18: every managed file removed,\nthe owner's `README.md` intact, and the hooks path init had set is unset. REQ-19: one path-free `metric.observed`\n(`value` 0, `unit_count` 1). The radar's production run waits for the owner's one-line apply of the job\n(`owner-apply-radar-policy.mjs`, ADR-2026 Amendment 1). The launch slot clause of REQ-15 waits for the launch lane\n(`../phase-08/launch-prompt.md`).","lineStart":1