ADR numbers 2023..2027. Phase numbers continue from Cycle 2 (08 onward), so every\\n9: evidence path the earlier cycles cite stays valid.\\n10: \\n11: ## Goal\\n12: \\n13: One sentence: **a fresh `git clone` of arc, opened in OpenCode with no install step, lists and runs the arc commands (verified\\n14: live), and opened in Codex lists them (verified by golden and docs only; a live Codex run is owed, not claimed); any project can see how far it is behind arc, move forward, or leave, with one manifest-driven verb each; and a\\n15: new venture is born with every harness — with Cycle 2's three debt holes closed first.**\\n16: \\n17: Out of scope: the model seat (ADR-2006), new harness rows, and `npm publish` (ADR-2008).\\n18: \\n19: ## Current state\\n20: \\n21: Verified 2026-10-14 at `4741c770` (codebase-surveyor + direc... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n29: {\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1791987597788,\"sessionID\":\"ses_ec53aa391ffe0Yfcjlez04t8W4\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_13ac8c1d7001mZAepQyCi7zriN\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"snapshot\":\"05841c741b6563798cecf7974a5e0cc664b5e5b6\",\"messageID\":\"msg_13ac86ab6001bscmtEDYnKNiOe\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_ec53aa391ffe0Yfcjlez04t8W4\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":16973,\"input\":2160,\"output\":163,\"reasoning\":58,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":14592}},\"cost\":0.000409472}}\n30: {\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1791987611613,\"sessionID\":\"ses_ec53aa391ffe0Yfcjlez04t8W4\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_13ac8f7d600115bfn9zci21uyX\",\"messageID\":\"msg_13ac8e198001lzPK5FvxlHLxtO\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_ec53aa391ffe0Yfcjlez04t8W4\",\"snapshot\":\"488303fae80b34bffaa1c2c49255524d9daee2ef\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\n31: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1791987630361,\"sessionID\":\"ses_ec53aa391ffe0Yfcjlez04t8W4\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_5da2eb7a75f54c66a093531d\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"E:\\\\Work_Hub\\\\01_Automemory