e-surveyor + direc... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n{\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1791987597788,\"sessionID\":\"ses_ec53aa391ffe0Yfcjlez04t8W4\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_13ac8c1d7001mZAepQyCi7zriN\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"snapshot\":\"05841c741b6563798cecf7974a5e0cc664b5e5b6\",\"messageID\":\"msg_13ac86ab6001bscmtEDYnKNiOe\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_ec53aa391ffe0Yfcjlez04t8W4\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":16973,\"input\":2160,\"output\":163,\"reasoning\":58,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":14592}},\"cost\":0.000409472}}\n{\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1791987611613,\"sessionID\":\"ses_ec53aa391ffe0Yfcjlez04t8W4\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_13ac8f7d600115bfn9zci21uyX\",\"messageID\":\"msg_13ac8e198001lzPK5FvxlHLxtO\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_ec53aa391ffe0Yfcjlez04t8W4\",\"snapshot\":\"488303fae80b34bffaa1c2c49255524d9daee2ef\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1791987630361,\"sessionID\":\"ses_ec53aa391ffe0Yfcjlez04t8W4\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_5da2eb7a75f54c66a093531d\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"E:\\\\Work_Hub\\\\01_Automemory\\\\wt-arc-kill2\\\\initiatives\\\\distribute\\\\phases\\\\phase-10-spec.md\"},\"output\":\"<path>E:\\\\Work_Hub\\\\01_Automemory\\\\wt-arc-kill2\\\\initiatives\\\\distribute\\\\phases\\\\phase-10-spec.md</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n1: # Phase 10 — `uninstall`, `init` for every harness, the consumer registry, the launch slot, the radar; retro and seal\\n2: \\n3: **Goal (one line):** `arc uninstall` removes exactly what the manifest lists, `arc init` with no `--target` renders every harness and registers the project locally, a new venture is born through the launch `core` slot with every harness, and a weekly ₹0 radar reports consumer drift without writing to any consumer.\\n4: **Appetite:** 1 day — blown appetite = cut scope or kill, never extend silently\\n5: **Depends on:** phase-09\\n6: **REQs closed here:** REQ-15, REQ-18, REQ-19\\n7: \\n8: ## Scope\\n9: \\n10: 1. `arc uninstall [--dir D] [--force]` (ADR-2024) with the mutant-manifest refusals and the `hooks_path_set` arms.\\n11: 2. `arc init` with no `--target` = the union of the four targets under ADR-2023's owner rule, one v2 manifest; registry append/remove in `$ARC_PRIVATE_DIR/consumers.json` (ADR-2026); `outdated --all`.\\n12: 3. Launch `core` slot calling `bin/arc.mjs init --dir <venture>`, after the launch lane confirms name and tier (paste-ready prompt to that session; A-17).\\n13: 4. `distribute-radar` job (`hq.jobs.yaml` row `cadence: daily@07:45` self-throttled to 7 days like `launch-watch`, `processes/distribute-radar.process.yaml` `job_stub: true`, `hq.policy.yaml` row, `.claude/scripts/hq/jobs/distribute-radar.mjs`) emitting one path-free `metric.observed`.\\n14: 5. The single cycle PR merged after CI green; from the main clone: tag `v0.2.0` on the merge commit (owner's explicit OK for t... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n{\"type\":\"text\",\"timestamp\":1791987631065,\"sessionID\":\"ses_ec53aa391ffe0Yfcjlez04t8W4\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_13ac93ead001bqwhzFMfTnkWFx\",\"messageID\":\"msg_13ac8e198001lzPK5FvxlHLxtO\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_ec53aa391ffe0Yfcjlez04t8W4\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"PROGRESS \\\"Now\\\" looks stale vs the done-log (P09/P10 already built + attacked; everything merged on `main` via #419). Reading the active phase spec (10) and the newest evidence to pin where it actually stopped.\",\"time\":{\"start\":1791987629741,\"end\":1791987631062}}}\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1791987631079,\"sessionID\":\"ses_ec53aa391ffe0Yfcjlez04t8W4\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_726af914aaa04f22a1a68c2d\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"E:\\\\Work_Hub\\\\01_Automemory\\\\wt-arc-kill2\\\\initiatives\\\\distribute\\\\evidence\\\\phase-10\\\\demo.md\"},\"output\":\"<path>E:\\\\Work_Hub\\\\01_Automemory\\\\wt-arc-kill2\\\\initiatives\\\\distribute\\\\evidence\\\\phase-10\\\\demo.md</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n1: # Phase 10 live demo — a venture born with every harness, watched by the radar, then uninstalled\\n2: \\n3: 2026-10-14, branch head `e08d759f`, a fresh git repo holding one owner file (`README.md`). `ARC_PRIVATE_DIR` pointed\\n4: at a demo dir and the radar's receipt went to a demo spine (`ARC_SPINE_ROOT`), so nothing reached the owner's\\n5: registry or the canonical spine. Paths below are shortened to `<demo>`.\\n6: \\n7: ```\\n8: $ node bin/arc.mjs init --dir <venture>\\n9: plan: claude-code+codex+opencode+skills-only — 669 file(s) into <demo>/venture\\n10: apply: wrote 670 file(s) into <demo>\\\\venture (every harness); record .arc-install.json\\n11: hooks: core.hooksPath=.claude/templates/githooks (branch guard + secret scan at commit time)\\n12: registry: registered <demo>\\\\venture\\n13: exit=0\\n14: dirs at birth: .agents/skills .arc-install.json .claude .codex .opencode \\n15: $ node bin/arc.mjs outdated --all\\n16: <demo>\\\\venture · up to date\\n17: outdated --all: 1 project(s) · 0 behind · 1 up to date · 0 unmeasurable · 0 missing\\n18: RAN arc-outdated\\n19: $ ARC_RADAR_FORCE=1 node .claude/scripts/hq/jobs/distribute-radar.mjs   # test spine\\n20: distribute-radar: metric.observed 01M4WPQMPWKJJRP9KC6BA3V3C1 · 0 of 1 behind · 0 unmeasurable · 0 missing\\n21: $ node bin/arc.mjs uninstall --dir <venture>\\n22: hooks: core.hooksPath unset (init had set it to .claude/templates/githooks)\\n23: registry: removed <demo>\\\\venture\\n24: uninstall: 669 removed, 0 kept, record .arc-install.json removed\\n25: RAN arc-uninstall\\n26: l... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n{\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1791987635101,\"sessionID\":\"ses_ec53aa391ffe0Yfcjlez04t8W4\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_13ac95397001taxTlrqK1j7v2x\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"snapshot\":\"488303fae80b34bffaa1c2c49255524d9daee2ef\",\"messageID\":\"msg_13ac8e198001lzPK5FvxlHLxtO\",\"ses